{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間11月13日，人工智能晶片巨頭英偉達董事會表示，公司尚未選定負責CEO招聘工作的獵頭機構，也尚未正式接觸任何潛在候選人。此番表態旨在回應近期圍繞前行政總裁黃仁勳繼任人選的大量市場猜測。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586320.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T21:28:11.433719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T21:00:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:21:25.351749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T21:21:25.351749+00:00","content_hash":"5cba4fbed0c45adf44824e66aef91021e390f1a341e7552fffdfa3a5a37d82a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}